        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ja\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>切腹の間とは？</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN\", \"Yu Gothic\", \"Noto Sans JP\", sans-serif;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    color: #111;\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 20px 24px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .header-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .title {\n    font-family: \"Kaisho\", \"HGGyoshotai\", \"Hannari\", serif;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    transform: skewX(-2deg);\n  }\n\n  .author {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n  }\n\n  p.body-text {\n    margin: 0 0 18px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n\n  .diagram-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin: 10px 0 20px 0;\n  }\n\n  .diagram-col {\n    position: relative;\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .num-label {\n    position: relative;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .mark-circle {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -8px;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 28px;\n    border: 2px solid #c0392b;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n  }\n\n  .mark-triangle {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -22px;\n    right: -6px;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 165px;\n    height: 165px;\n    background: #a7d18a;\n    border: 3px solid #1a1a1a;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #333;\n    padding: 4px;\n  }\n\n  /* Simple internal lines to suggest tatami mat divisions */\n  .placeholder::before,\n  .placeholder::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    background: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n\n  .tatami1::before { top: 0; left: 33%; width: 4px; height: 66%; }\n  .tatami1::after  { top: 66%; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 4px; }\n\n  .tatami2::before { top: 33%; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 4px; }\n  .tatami2::after  { top: 33%; left: 66%; width: 4px; height: 67%; }\n\n  .tatami3::before { top: 0; left: 33%; width: 4px; height: 33%; }\n  .tatami3::after  { top: 33%; left: 33%; width: 67%; height: 4px; }\n\n  .caption-inner {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);\n    padding: 2px 4px;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .bottom-section {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 16px;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n\n  .bottom-text {\n    flex: 1.4;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n\n  .floorplan-wrap {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .floorplan {\n    width: 190px;\n    height: 220px;\n    border: 3px solid #1a1a1a;\n    position: relative;\n    background: #f5f5f0;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .fp-label {\n    position: absolute;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n\n  .fp-arrow-up {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 8px;\n    left: 8px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .fp-tokonoma {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    width: 55px;\n    height: 90px;\n    background: #c9a06a;\n    border-left: 3px solid #1a1a1a;\n    border-bottom: 3px solid #1a1a1a;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n\n  .fp-hori {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 100px;\n    left: 60px;\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 60px;\n    border: 2px solid #1a1a1a;\n    background: #eee;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .fp-entrance-arrows {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 60px;\n    left: 12px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #333;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n\n  .fp-caption {\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #555;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"header-row\">\n    <div class=\"title\">切腹の間とは？</div>\n    <div class=\"author\">@吉田誠治</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"body-text\">\n    四畳半の畳の敷き方について、たまに「切腹の間」という話を聞きます。多くの場合は③のような敷き方については縁起が悪いので避けるべきだということのようですが、調べてみてもきちんとした出典がなく（いくつかの工務店等のウェブサイトに中途半端な言及がある程度）、内容も地方によってまちまちなので、気にする必要はあまり無さそうです。どうしても気になるようであれば、③についてはなるべく避けるようにする、ぐらいで大丈夫だと思います。\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"diagram-row\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-col\">\n      <div class=\"num-label\">\n        <span class=\"mark-circle\"></span>①\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder tatami1\">\n        <span class=\"caption-inner\">[Diagram: tatami layout ①]</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"diagram-col\">\n      <div class=\"num-label\">\n        <span class=\"mark-circle\"></span>②\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder tatami2\">\n        <span class=\"caption-inner\">[Diagram: tatami layout ②]</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"diagram-col\">\n      <div class=\"num-label\">\n        ③\n        <span class=\"mark-triangle\">△?</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder tatami3\">\n        <span class=\"caption-inner\">[Diagram: tatami layout ③]</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-section\">\n    <p class=\"bottom-text\">\n      むしろ和室では、床の間に対して畳の長辺が平行になることや、出入り口に対して畳の目が垂直になることが重要です。さらに茶室や掘り炬燵のある和室では中央に畳の目が来るので、右図のような間取りでは③のような敷き方になることも多いようです。ただこれらも「できればやる」程度の決まり事で、場合によって変わってくるし、あまり拘りすぎないのが良いと思います。\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"floorplan-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"floorplan\">\n        <div class=\"fp-arrow-up\">↑出入口</div>\n        <div class=\"fp-entrance-arrows\">↓↓<br>目の方向</div>\n        <div class=\"fp-tokonoma\">床の間</div>\n        <div class=\"fp-hori\">堀りごたつ</div>\n        <div class=\"fp-label\" style=\"top:130px; right:60px; writing-mode:vertical-rl;\">目の方向</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"fp-caption\">[Diagram: room floor plan with entrance, tokonoma, and hori-gotatsu]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
